This is the recreation of my Nutrition app using my industry standard coding practices. 
The app calculates the user's daily nutrient needs based on their age, weight, height, and activity level. It also provides a breakdown of macronutrients (carbohydrates, proteins, and fats) based on the calculated caloric needs. The app is designed to be user-friendly and visually appealing, with a clean and modern interface.



# 1. Core Product Features 


## Authentication & Accounts

* User registration/login
* Password hashing
* Session management or JWT auth
* Password reset
* Email verification
* Profile settings
* Guest mode (optional)

Recommended:

* OAuth login (Google/Apple)

## Nutrition Tracking

* Search foods
* Add foods to meals
* Track:

  * calories
  * protein
  * carbs
  * fats
* Serving size adjustments
* Daily nutrition totals
* Meal categories:

  * breakfast
  * lunch
  * dinner
  * snacks

## Food Database

* Structured food records
* Branded + generic foods
* Nutrition per serving
* Search indexing/tokenization
* Synonym handling
* Pagination

## Daily Logging System

* Save food logs by date
* Edit/delete entries
* Historical tracking
* Calendar/day navigation

## Goals

* Calorie target
* Macro targets
* Weight goal
* Maintenance/bulk/cut presets

## Dashboard

* Daily macro progress
* Remaining calories
* Weight trends
* Streaks/history

---

